 municipality, 2024 (geo.upme.gov.co), accessed 2026-11-15; UPME declares\nno licence. Lights: NASA GIBS, Gap-Filled BRDF Corrected Radiance (Day/Night Band, NOAA-20), 14 January 2025. Departments: DANE, MGN 2025.\nHow it was made: all in RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app): GIBS tiles with the date in the address, amber tint in multiply and a mask (Erase);\none point per municipality (Feature To Point) and circles sized by expression. Scripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":5.5,"color":[127,138,153,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":48,"name":"Text","x":12.0,"y":292.3,"w":186.0,"h":4.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"© José Gregorio Rincón · CC BY 4.0 · #30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Day 17: Light & dark · Made with RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":6.5,"color":[255,196,107,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":49}],"folders":[],"styles":[],"ramps":[],"tasks":[],"gp_env":{"extent":null,"cell_size":null},"models":[],"workspaces":[],"link_views":false,"jobs":[],"offline_areas":[],"reports":[],"presentations":[],"notebooks":[],"dl_models":[],"shared":[],"data_stores":[]}